If you have your ascension kit filled out, there is no rule stating that 
you must explore all the mazes to their fullest.  You could benefit from 
finding some potions useful for alchemy to raise your max hps, and this 
is more likely to happen for you if seek out monsters and find the 
objects generated in the mazes; but certainly not a mandatory thing. 
The other caveat to this is that without having the levels between the 
tower entrance and where you've stopped exploring mapped out, your 
ascension run will be slowed.

