> 
> So should I waste wishes/ on markers or ?oCharging to get better AC??
> Or save those wishes??

If you know that you're about to use up the last charge on your 0:XX 
magic marker, use it to write a scroll of charging rather than anything 
else!  Now that you're in this pickle, though, it may be prudent to wish 
for a couple of scrolls of charging to get the full use out of your 
markers.  Anything to improve your AC to below -30 is suggested for 
preparation to ascend.

