Are you sure that you didn't take a plunge into some water?  AFAIK the 
only way you can get a scroll turned into blank paper is via a 
cancellation beam aimed at it or through it getting wet.


> 3) I haven't genocided ANYTHING. Disenchanters are eating me alive (see
> above). I have run into no less than 4 of them. But, even worse, 2 were
> summoned by an arch lich. Mind flayers have been a problem, too. Should
> I use wishes on Genocide scrolls?? or charging to write them?

You're gambling if you try to write an unknown scroll - but if you do 
know what genocide scrolls look like and just lost them in a way similar 
to the loss of the scrolls of charging, then by all means use a wish to 
get those magic markers regenerated.  Since you've never ascended 
before, you need to take any advantages you can get!  Feel free to use 
genocide to make it that much less harrowing ;)

Best wishes, good luck!

